<span class="dim">   </span>                                                              pointer depth on refs
<span class="dim"> 5</span>    Philosophy scene  PhilosophyScene.tsx React + CSS         SceneController state
<span class="dim"> 6</span>    Services scene    ServicesScene.tsx   React + CSS         SceneController state;
<span class="dim">   </span>                                                              per-card stagger
<span class="dim"> 7</span>    Work scene        WorkScene.tsx       React + CSS         SceneController state;
<span class="dim">   </span>                                                              hover dim on siblings
