<span class="dim">9999</span>  Loader overlay    BootSystem.ts       React inline styles Unmounted 1.3s post-entry
        </pre>
      </div>

      <div class="cs-callout">
        <p>
          <strong>atmosphereReady gate:</strong> All atmosphere components
          (DotGrid, ThreeCanvas, DepthLayer, CursorField) are gated behind a
          React state flag that is only set when the
          <code style="font-family:var(--f-mono);font-size:0.85em">cinematic-entry</code>
          event fires. They do not mount during the boot sequence — their RAF
          loops and WebGL context are created only when they are about to
          be visible.
        </p>
      </div>
